1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,460
Now let two waves meet head on.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:10,156
They have the same amplitude, the same frequency and the same speed, but they travel in opposite directions.

3
00:00:10,156 --> 00:00:20,117
In practice the second is usually the reflection of the first, from the fixed end of a sarangi string, or the end of the air column in a flute.

